    <p>Here's a timeline of my professional work history. Check out my <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1K2X4IXfC_pT89qWW0VB3owgSdMlNo7JG/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link">resume</a> for a detailed version.</p>
    <WorkTimeline />
  </SectionLayout>
</BaseLayout>
